OL,3,ATens of thousands of fridge freezers
OL,4,Aleft at docks as household collections
OL,5,Asuspended
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople have reported storing broken
OL,8,Ffridges and freezers in their gardens
OL,9,Ffor months because some council
OL,10,Fcollections have been suspended.
OL,12,FIt follows the closure of specialist
OL,13,Ftreatment facilities and a wider
OL,14,Fshortage of capacity to process cooling
OL,15,Fappliances, the Local Government
OL,16,FAuthority (LGA) said.
OL,18,FRecycling company Unimetals, which had
OL,19,Fdozens of sites in the UK, filed for
OL,20,Fliquidation in 2025 leaving tens of
OL,21,Fthousands of fridge freezers at Newport
OL,22,FDocks.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
