OL,3,ATens of thousands of fridge freezers
OL,4,Aleft at docks as household collections
OL,5,Asuspended
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,8,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) said it was
OL,9,Fworking to manage the capacity
OL,10,Fshortages.
